{"version": 2, "width": 78, "height": 66, "timestamp": 1788024243, "idle_time_limit": 2.0, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/zsh", "TERM": null}}
[0.192218, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.548007, "o", "  ONE DEPOT, ONE NIGHT, THREE SETTLEMENTS\r\n"]
[0.674369, "o", "  depot-north — 18 vans on a congestion-constrained connection\r\n"]
[0.796171, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.150844, "o", "ACT 1  the meter reports\r\n"]
[2.057502, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[2.184292, "o", "  02:00: 22 kW   register 105500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.311022, "o", "  02:15: 22 kW   register 111000 Wh\r\n"]
[2.43773, "o", "  02:30: 22 kW   register 116500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.564558, "o", "  02:45: 22 kW   register 122000 Wh\r\n"]
[2.691216, "o", "  03:00: 22 kW   register 127500 Wh\r\n"]
[2.814247, "o", "  03:15: 15 kW   register 131250 Wh\r\n"]
[2.939329, "o", "  03:30: 15 kW   register 135000 Wh\r\n"]
[3.066179, "o", "  03:45: 15 kW   register 138750 Wh\r\n"]
[3.191786, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.547383, "o", "  every reading signed by the charge point's own key, verifiable\r\n"]
[3.674145, "o", "  offline by anyone holding the platform's public key\r\n"]
[3.797544, "o", "\r\n"]
[4.150518, "o", "ACT 2  the aggregator asks to curtail\r\n"]
[5.057501, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[5.18424, "o", "  03:14: curtail depot-north-cp-04 from 22 kW to 7 kW for 40 minutes\r\n"]
[5.307081, "o", "\r\n"]
[5.661725, "o", "  no capability: REFUSED — malformed capability token\r\n"]
[5.783578, "o", "  wrong issuer: REFUSED — capability token signature is not valid for this issuer\r\n"]
[5.909092, "o", "  the real capability: held for review — shed of 15000W is at or above the review threshold of 11000W\r\n"]
[6.031762, "o", "\r\n"]
[6.385878, "o", "  15 kW is within the 15 kW granted but past the 11 kW review threshold,\r\n"]
[6.512568, "o", "  and no operator is wired in — so the command is NOT dispatched.\r\n"]
[6.6388, "o", "  Nothing reached the charge point. The refusal is on the record.\r\n"]
[6.76205, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.117488, "o", "  re-presented, 7 kW shed: allowed\r\n"]
[7.241981, "o", "  03:14: SetChargingProfile dispatched, hung under the authority that permitted it\r\n"]
[7.368921, "o", "\r\n"]
[7.726401, "o", "ACT 3  morning — three settlements, one chain\r\n"]
[8.633225, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[8.760349, "o", "  energy bill: 38 kWh   EUR 10.64\r\n"]
[9.267473, "o", "  flexibility payment: 4 kWh   EUR 0.48\r\n"]
[9.77475, "o", "  baseline used: 22 kW, metered 15 kW\r\n"]
[9.901804, "o", "  method: nominated baseline  fingerprint e19ee448668d7b77\r\n"]
[10.023886, "o", "\r\n"]
[10.380496, "o", "  aggregator invoices: 10 kWh — the 15 kW shed it asked for at 03:14\r\n"]
[11.484687, "o", "  meter says: 4666 Wh — the 7 kW shed that was actually dispatched\r\n"]
[12.591602, "o", "  over-claim: 114%\r\n"]
[14.195685, "o", "\r\n"]
[14.552682, "o", "  the DSO pays the aggregator: 10 kWh   EUR 1.80 — on the claim\r\n"]
[15.659573, "o", "  the aggregator pays the depot: 4 kWh   EUR 0.48 — on the meter\r\n"]
[16.762318, "o", "  kept on the gap: EUR 1.32\r\n"]
[18.566586, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.92109, "o", "  the deep shed was HELD in Act 2, so it never reached the meter. The\r\n"]
[19.04775, "o", "  aggregator is paid upstream for a shed that did not happen, and pays\r\n"]
[19.174519, "o", "  downstream for the one that did. Both sides are on this chain, and the\r\n"]
[19.301331, "o", "  DSO — who was never in the room — can walk it.\r\n"]
[19.423678, "o", "\r\n"]
[19.780075, "o", "  The percentage is recorded, not enforced: a threshold belongs in a\r\n"]
[19.906979, "o", "  contract, not in a library.\r\n"]
[20.031629, "o", "\r\n"]
[20.387918, "o", "\r\n"]
[20.741628, "o", "  all three derive from the same signed readings. Walking up from the\r\n"]
[20.86418, "o", "  DSO's payment — the furthest party from the meter:\r\n"]
[20.989764, "o", "\r\n"]
[21.346587, "o", "    settlement.grid\r\n"]
[21.473451, "o", "    settlement.flex\r\n"]
[21.600558, "o", "    curtail.applied\r\n"]
[21.725467, "o", "    grid.allowed\r\n"]
[21.850644, "o", "    grid.intent\r\n"]
[21.977337, "o", "    curtail.command\r\n"]
[22.104422, "o", "    meter.reading\r\n"]
[22.231281, "o", "\r\n"]
[22.588799, "o", "ACT 4  somebody edits a meter value\r\n"]
[23.495716, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[23.622635, "o", "  edit: 03:15 register 131250 Wh -> 134750 Wh   (+3.5 kWh of flexibility, worth EUR 0.42)\r\n"]
[23.749745, "o", "\r\n"]
[24.106788, "o", "  result: signature check fails at 03:15 — that reading, and only that reading\r\n"]
[24.232384, "o", "\r\n"]
[24.585373, "o", "  the edit did not need to be guessed at. Every other reading still\r\n"]
[24.712814, "o", "  verifies, so the chain names the one that does not.\r\n"]
[24.840289, "o", "\r\n"]
[25.19267, "o", "--------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[25.315897, "o", "  Every settlement above walks back to a signed meter reading,\r\n"]
[25.443044, "o", "  through the capability that authorised the command that changed it.\r\n"]
[25.569613, "o", "  A command without that authority never reached the charge point.\r\n"]
[25.692289, "o", "\r\n"]
[26.049463, "o", "  The baseline remains a model. This makes the flexibility claim\r\n"]
[26.175934, "o", "  checkable and replayable by any party — not true.\r\n"]
[26.29868, "o", "\r\n"]
